This product is a community port of the "Resin" integration plugin that was
originally published by JetBrains s.r.o. on the JetBrains Marketplace
(Marketplace plugin ID 14598, plugin ID com.intellij.resin), distributed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The source code in this repository was reconstructed from the last publicly
available build of that plugin (version 232.6734.9) and subsequently ported to
newer IntelliJ Platform APIs. Modifications include, but are not limited to:

  - rebuilding the project with the IntelliJ Platform Gradle Plugin 2.x;
  - extracting nested model-data classes into top-level classes;
  - removing decompiler-generated synthetic members;
  - hardening version parsing for newer Resin releases;
  - extending the supported IDE build range up to 2026.x.

